            <h4>UP Police Department Cadres</h4>
            <div class="cadre-badge">Law Enforcement & Security</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Ranks:</strong> Constable (Level 3: ₹21,700), Head Constable (Level 4: ₹25,500), Sub-Inspector (Level 6: ₹35,400), and Inspector (Level 7: ₹44,900).</p>
            <p><strong>Operational Impact:</strong> Police personnel draw specialized risk, uniform, and motorcycle allowances in addition to baseline pay. Level 3 constables will see baseline pay expand to <strong>₹49,476</strong> under the 2.28 factor.</p>
            <span class="cadre-footer">7th CPC Base: ₹21,700 | 8th CPC (2.28x): <strong>₹49,476</strong></span>
          </div>

          <div class="cadre-box education">
            <h4>Basic Shiksha Parishad Teachers</h4>
            <div class="cadre-badge">Primary & Upper Primary Education</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Ranks:</strong> Assistant Teacher Primary (Level 6: ₹35,400), Headmaster Primary / Assistant Teacher Upper Primary (Level 7: ₹44,900), and Headmaster Junior High School (Level 8: ₹47,600).</p>
            <p><strong>Operational Impact:</strong> Primary teachers represent the largest single budgetary employee cohort in UP. Under the 8th CPC, their starting basic salary will reach <strong>₹80,712 per month</strong>.</p>
            <span class="cadre-footer">7th CPC Base: ₹35,400 | 8th CPC (2.28x): <strong>₹80,712</strong></span>
          </div>

          <div class="cadre-box revenue">
            <h4>Revenue & Rural Development Cadres</h4>
            <div class="cadre-badge">Field Administration</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Ranks:</strong> Revenue Lekhpal (Level 3: ₹21,700), Gram Panchayat Adhikari / VDO (Level 5: ₹29,200), Revenue Inspector / Kanoongo (Level 5: ₹29,200), and Naib Tehsildar (Level 8: ₹47,600).</p>
            <p><strong>Operational Impact:</strong> Lekhpals and VDOs manage grassroots land administration and panchayat governance, benefiting from substantial basic pay expansion under the new matrix.</p>
            <span class="cadre-footer">7th CPC Base: ₹21,700 | 8th CPC (2.28x): <strong>₹49,476</strong></span>
          </div>

          <div class="cadre-box sachivalaya">
            <h4>UP Sachivalaya (Secretariat Cadre)</h4>
            <div class="cadre-badge">Executive Administration</div>
            <p><strong>Covered Ranks:</strong> Review Officer / Samiksha Adhikari (Level 8: ₹47,600), Section Officer / Anubhag Adhikari (Level 9: ₹53,100), and Under Secretary (Level 11: ₹67,700).</p>
            <p><strong>Operational Impact:</strong> The secretariat cadre in Lucknow forms the administrative hub of policy clearance and legislative drafting for the state administration.</p>
            <span class="cadre-footer">7th CPC Base: ₹47,600 | 8th CPC (2.28x): <strong>₹1,08,528</strong></span>
          </div>
        </div>
